1 finding(s): 1 to fix; 1 on their lines. Reply in a comment's thread to answer it.

### Summary

The 5-line change in `relocateFolder` adds a sync detection for the new folder and returns the refreshed workspace view. One problem: for the active workspace, the relocation commits and the windows re-list before `syncStates.refresh` runs, unlike add/create. A folder that only the xattr check recognises as synced is treated as not synced during that re-list. I raised one `fix` (medium confidence). None of the open threads sit on this file, so there are no thread replies.

